* Arguments with !, <, > or = passed on by a macro to one using \Ln: on the r68L call line too in
* <> (Put >123,= : as took the bare = for a keyword argument; Put x<>1,... and Put C!,C lost
* characters, so the length chose the wrong size).
* fixed: 8de3936 2026-10-11 r68togas: arguments through r68L in <> on its call line
* expect text: 2afc3e31 32331afc 003d2afc 783c3e31 2afc4162 43643afc 43211afc 00434e71
PutBWL macro
 ifgt \L1-1
 ifgt \L1-2
 move.l #'\1',(a5)+
 else
 move.w #'\1',(a5)+
 endc
 else
 move.b #'\1',(a5)+
 endc
 endm
Put macro
 PutBWL \1
 PutBWL \2
 endm
 psect lmacro_via_specials,0,0,0,0,0
 Put >123,=
 Put x<>1,AbCd
 Put C!,C
 nop
 ends
